{"n": 293, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "293.webp", "text": "id\nBM,\n\n41007\n\n1341003\n\n13-65\n\n13.41 000 REMOVING AND INSTALLING\nIDLE SPEED CONTROL\nVALVE\n\nM206 20\n\nM206 25\n\nPull off plug ((1).\nDisconnect strap (2).\n\nPull idle speed contro! valve off of\nhoses and remove.\n\ninstallation:\nCheck code number (1)*.\n(Check Idle speed\".\n\nNote:\nOperation of the idie speed contro!\nvalve can be fell by grabbing hold of\nthe valve with a hand (timed power\nsupply).\n\nMechanical Test:\n\nIt should be possible to move the rota-\nry piston (1) in the idle speed contro!\nvalve by turning the idle speed control\nvalve suddenty.\n\n* See Specifications of Gr. 11 and 13\n\nElectric Test;\n\nMeasure resistance between terminals\n(1 and 3);\nSpecification= approx. 40 ohms.\nMeasure resistance between terminals\n(2 and 1) or (2 and 3);\n\n= appros. 20 ohms each.\n\nDynamic Test;\n\nRemove Idle speed control valve (plug\nremains connected).\n\nOpen or close rotary piston (1) com-\npletely.\n\nTum on ignition.\n\nRotary piston must move to and remain\nIn a position equal to about 50 % of\nthe cross section opening.", "words": [["id", 0.0096, 0.3459, 0.0177, 0.3564], ["BM,", 0.0187, 0.3406, 0.0277, 0.371], ["41007", 0.2084, 0.5195, 0.2492, 0.5287], ["1341003", 0.2043, 0.971, 0.2472, 0.9802], ["13-65", 0.4692, 0.035, 0.5288, 0.0594], ["13.41", 0.2714, 0.0739, 0.2977, 0.0858], ["000", 0.3037, 0.0739, 0.3219, 0.0858], ["REMOVING", 0.329, 0.0726, 0.39, 0.0858], ["AND", 0.394, 0.0726, 0.4173, 0.0845], ["INSTALLING", 0.4213, 0.0726, 0.4884, 0.0845], ["IDLE", 0.329, 0.0898, 0.3547, 0.1017], ["SPEED", 0.3587, 0.0898, 0.3961, 0.1017], ["CONTROL", 0.4001, 0.0884, 0.4551, 0.1017], ["VALVE", 0.329, 0.1069, 0.3668, 0.1188], ["M206", 0.2714, 0.1399, 0.3249, 0.1518], ["20", 0.3123, 0.136, 0.3269, 0.1584], ["M206", 0.2714, 0.1558, 0.3249, 0.1677], ["25", 0.3123, 0.1518, 0.3269, 0.1743], ["Pull", 0.2704, 0.1677, 0.2926, 0.1908], ["off", 0.2967, 0.1677, 0.3103, 0.1908], ["plug", 0.3